; Lost Zone (doc 101): how a device sits in the LEFT hand seen from the side.
; section = h, p, b (degrees), x, y, z (m) from bip01_l_hand. Tune in the game:
;   netcoop_hand_grip <section> h p b x y z   (prints the line to paste here)
; Start: the grip of the anomaly scanner NPCs hold upright in the left hand
; (the hand torch had the headlamp's head-bone offset, glow sticks the detector's).
[netcoop_hand_grips]
; Turn the hand torch 180 degrees about its local Y axis: its model and beam
; face forward together. Keep the grip point and the upright axis unchanged.
